{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 200,
    "dDurationMs": 1792,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This is a robot that can grow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1992,
    "dDurationMs": 2938,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to hundreds of times its size,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4930,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it can't be stopped\nby adhesives or spikes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9050,
    "dDurationMs": 2410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Although it looks kind\nof simple and cheap,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11460,
    "dDurationMs": 2390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it has dozens of potential applications,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13850,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "including, one day maybe saving your life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18920,
    "dDurationMs": 2170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This video is sponsored by Morning Brew,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21090,
    "dDurationMs": 1983,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the free daily newsletter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24130,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now I made a video before\nabout a soft truss robot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27340,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is also a soft robot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29840,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but very different in how\nit works and what it can do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33700,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These robots can be made\nout of almost any material,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36500,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they all follow the\nsame basic principle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39200,
    "dDurationMs": 3418,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Powered by compressed air,\nthey grow from the tip."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42618,
    "dDurationMs": 1092,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(air hissing)\n(object rustling)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43710,
    "dDurationMs": 1416,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That's good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46380,
    "dDurationMs": 3790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And this allows the robot\nto pass through tight spaces,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50170,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and also over sticky surfaces."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53350,
    "dDurationMs": 2865,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Something like a car\nwill get stuck to it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56215,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(car winding)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59568,
    "dDurationMs": 1162,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It gets stuck in the wheels."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60730,
    "dDurationMs": 1677,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, if I do the same\nthing with the vine robot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62407,
    "dDurationMs": 2143,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "see the robot is able to extend..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64550,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It can navigate this\ncurvy and twisted passageway"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67700,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "effortlessly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68810,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which suggests some of the applications"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70610,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's well-suited for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72330,
    "dDurationMs": 2830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now you might think spikes\nwould be the downfall"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75160,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of an inflatable robot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76930,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but even if it's punctured,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79030,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as long as you have\nsufficient air pressure,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81380,
    "dDurationMs": 2030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the robot keeps going."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83410,
    "dDurationMs": 1342,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And you might be able to hear it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84752,
    "dDurationMs": 1418,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(air hissing)\nIt's actually leaking now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86170,
    "dDurationMs": 2024,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I'll have to turn up the pressure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88194,
    "dDurationMs": 2896,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(object rustling)\n(air hissing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91090,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This by itself is not yet a robot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92800,
    "dDurationMs": 2950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but once we add steering,\na camera, some sensors,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95750,
    "dDurationMs": 3190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and maybe some intelligence as\nto where we're directing it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98940,
    "dDurationMs": 1150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then we could say it's a robot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100090,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is sort of the\nbackbone of our robot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102300,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is what allows us to\nbuild our type of robots."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105740,
    "dDurationMs": 2830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So where did the idea\nfor this device come from?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108570,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I had a vine in my\noffice that was on a shelf,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112830,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it was kind of out of the sunlight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114960,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And over the course of like a year or so,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116680,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it slowly grew out this tender roll"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118430,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out and around the edge of the shelf"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120830,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and towards the sunlight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122360,
    "dDurationMs": 3130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I said, \"That's a pretty cool\nthing it just did,\" right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125490,
    "dDurationMs": 1217,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I started thinking,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126707,
    "dDurationMs": 2413,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Well is there a way you\ncan do that robotically?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129120,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The solution is really\nelegant in its simplicity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132520,
    "dDurationMs": 3910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just take some airtight tubing\nand fold it in on itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136430,
    "dDurationMs": 1930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's kind of like a water wiggle,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138360,
    "dDurationMs": 3302,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "those toys that are really hard to hold."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141662,
    "dDurationMs": 948,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(air hissing)\nWhen you inflate it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142610,
    "dDurationMs": 3550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with compressed air, it starts\ngrowing out from the tip."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146160,
    "dDurationMs": 2990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you want the tube to\nalways bend at a certain spot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149150,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you could just tape the\ntubing on the outside"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151460,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to shorten one of the sides."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153770,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, you could tape\nit into a helical shape"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156310,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to create a deployable antenna."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159600,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What about getting them to retract?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161540,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, that's a challenging problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163670,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you're in a constrained environment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164990,
    "dDurationMs": 1670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all you really have to do"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166660,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is pull on, we call it the tail,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169930,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the material that is passing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171690,
    "dDurationMs": 1430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through the core of the body,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173120,
    "dDurationMs": 1690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you pull on it and it basically ungrows,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174810,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it just goes back inside itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176450,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, if you're in a big\nopen area like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178730,
    "dDurationMs": 1670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you try pulling on that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180400,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "instead of inverting, so retracting,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183360,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it tends to kind of coil\nup and make a ugly shape."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187000,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And the engineers have come up with ways"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188410,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to retract the tube to\nprevent it from buckling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191560,
    "dDurationMs": 2590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "using internal rollers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194150,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the two doesn't have\nto be the same diameter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196550,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the whole way along,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197660,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "here there's actually\na much wider section,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199860,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "think of it like a pillow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201690,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's packed into the end of the robot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203880,
    "dDurationMs": 1627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, if you could\nsit cross-legged on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205507,
    "dDurationMs": 2523,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Cross-legged on the table."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208030,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This sounds (groans) super sketchy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210600,
    "dDurationMs": 3370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So it grows underneath\nthe table just as usual,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213970,
    "dDurationMs": 2545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then as the pillow\npart starts inflating,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216515,
    "dDurationMs": 2008,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(object clattering)\n(man mumbles)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218523,
    "dDurationMs": 2277,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is this not good, or is this okay?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220800,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It can actually lift me up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225060,
    "dDurationMs": 3245,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So my balance is not great as we can see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228305,
    "dDurationMs": 1804,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You're standing on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230109,
    "dDurationMs": 1411,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Stand on it?\n- Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231520,
    "dDurationMs": 2770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- What's amazing is that this\ndoesn't require much pressure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234290,
    "dDurationMs": 1550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "above atmospheric,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235840,
    "dDurationMs": 1670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just a 10th of an atmosphere"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237510,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "applied over a large\narea like a square meter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240710,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can lift something as\nheavy as 1000 kilograms,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244430,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all the while remaining soft."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246350,
    "dDurationMs": 2199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(object rustling)\nOh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248549,
    "dDurationMs": 1771,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whoa, (sighs) that was great."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250320,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the paradoxical\nthing about pressure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252750,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can get a large overall\nforce with low pressure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255910,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as long as the area is large enough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258230,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What sort of area is\nthat, that pillow there?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261350,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's 600 square inches."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262470,
    "dDurationMs": 3430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All right, so with one\nPSI it's 600 pounds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265900,
    "dDurationMs": 1270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah.\n- Yeah. (laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267170,
    "dDurationMs": 1777,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Two PSI is 1200 pounds.\n- That's just crazy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268947,
    "dDurationMs": 1743,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the whole time it feels really soft."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270690,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, 'cause there's\na couple PSI, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272440,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's important that\nthe device is still soft"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274780,
    "dDurationMs": 1570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it doesn't hurt anyone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276350,
    "dDurationMs": 1510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So you can design these things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277860,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to have cross-section that\nchanges along its length."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281530,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it can be a very small body"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283970,
    "dDurationMs": 2870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that could grow into, for\nexample, a collapsed building"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286840,
    "dDurationMs": 2950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and potentially lift a large object"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289790,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "off someone who's trapped,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291090,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or maybe in a car crash\nor something like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293460,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It can apply huge forces"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295640,
    "dDurationMs": 1070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with very soft\n(air whooshing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296710,
    "dDurationMs": 2090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and lightweight cheap material."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298800,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- These robots can also be deployed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300380,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in search and rescue operations"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302180,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by attaching sensors like\na camera onto the front."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305760,
    "dDurationMs": 1930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- These robots are actually\nreally hard to stop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307690,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you can take them,\ngrow them into a clutter,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310930,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "potentially a class building\nor something like that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312940,
    "dDurationMs": 3070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they will continue to go somewhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316010,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And alternative is they're so cheap,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317730,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, they're basically free."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318960,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You could grow a hundred\nof them, let's say,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320610,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into a collapsed building\nwith some sensing on them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323350,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and maybe only one of them finds somebody."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326490,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, that's a huge success if it does."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329250,
    "dDurationMs": 1690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But how do you keep a camera connected"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330940,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the front of the robot when\nit grows out from the tip?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334340,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, one way is to use an end cap"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336550,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which allows that camera\njust to stay on the front,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339250,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pushed from behind by the robot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341150,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but there are other\nmechanisms of attachment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343580,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The tiny wireless camera is\nmounted on an external frame,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347680,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but this frame interlocks\nwith an internal frame"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350600,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is actually inside\nthe pressurized part"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353140,
    "dDurationMs": 1250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the robot body."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354390,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's similar to how a\nroller coaster's wheels"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356810,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "go around the track."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 358910,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this prevents the\ncamera from falling off"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361150,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as the robot grows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362850,
    "dDurationMs": 1150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's really interesting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364000,
    "dDurationMs": 3950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is how the vine robot\ncan be actively steered."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367950,
    "dDurationMs": 3366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They attach artificial\nmuscles to the robot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371316,
    "dDurationMs": 2404,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(air hissing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373720,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the way this muscle works"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375440,
    "dDurationMs": 3530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that if you inflate\nit, it expands sideways,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378970,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which leads to it contracting in length."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381890,
    "dDurationMs": 1630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We don't actually use these much anymore"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383520,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because although it's soft,\nit's still somewhat stiff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386540,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what we use instead"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388290,
    "dDurationMs": 2710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are simply tubes of this\nripstop nylon fabric"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391000,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the braid oriented at 45 degrees."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393360,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in this sense"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394193,
    "dDurationMs": 2559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we just have one single\nlayer of airtight fabric."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396752,
    "dDurationMs": 2208,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(air hissing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398960,
    "dDurationMs": 1930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the main robot body here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400890,
    "dDurationMs": 2830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then we have three pneumatic\nmuscles connected to it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403720,
    "dDurationMs": 1270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, these three muscles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404990,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are each connected to their own air supply"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406570,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "connected to regulators over here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408670,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As the robot extends from the tip,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410380,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we can steer it by shortening\nand lengthening the sides."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412840,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, you know, just the way your hand works"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414520,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is if I shorten this tendon in my arm"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 416740,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "my hand will move this way,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418260,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or if I shorten the one on this side"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419660,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it'll move the other way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420700,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So our vine robot, we have\nthese muscles along its side,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423440,
    "dDurationMs": 2510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so as they inflate\nthey'll turn it one way,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425950,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then if I deflate the\none on the other side,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427820,
    "dDurationMs": 1190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it'll turn the other way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429010,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So the vine robot can\nfit through tight spaces."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431810,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It doesn't typically get stuck on anything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433710,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and isn't bothered by sharp objects."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436050,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And once you attach that\ncamera on the front,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438240,
    "dDurationMs": 2817,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's ideal for things like archeology."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441057,
    "dDurationMs": 2773,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(group chattering)\n(objects clanking)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443830,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The robot was actually taken to Peru"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446070,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to investigate some very narrow shafts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449430,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So we were looking at\nthis archeological site"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452330,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that was built somewhere\nbetween 1500 and 500 BC"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456570,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the Andes mountains of Peru,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458670,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it was an ancient temple"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 460260,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that had all these underground spaces."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462580,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And part of what the\narcheologists were doing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465590,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was trying to understand\nwhat the spaces were for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468470,
    "dDurationMs": 1630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what the people who built them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 470100,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were trying to do with them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471720,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So part of that was unknown,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473100,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but there were these giant rooms\nthat they called galleries,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476600,
    "dDurationMs": 2830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then there were these\nsmall ducts or tunnels"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 479430,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that were offshoots of these rooms,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482400,
    "dDurationMs": 3070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they wanted to know\nwhere these ducts led"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485470,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they were too small\nfor a person to go in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487840,
    "dDurationMs": 2590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we were able to\nsuccessfully use the vine robot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490430,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to explore three of the tunnels"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492300,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that couldn't have been\nseen through other means,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494620,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which was super exciting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495720,
    "dDurationMs": 3153,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we got video inside the entire tunnels"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498873,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and gave it to the archeology team."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502130,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- There's an application"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502963,
    "dDurationMs": 3157,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where I feel like this\nsolution is just so obvious"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506120,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wonder why it didn't exist before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508580,
    "dDurationMs": 4430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Intubation is literally\nthe process of putting a tube"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513010,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into a patient."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514030,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The purpose is to breathe for the patient"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517110,
    "dDurationMs": 1150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when the patient isn't breathing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518260,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so traditionally a highly\ntrained medical professional"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521600,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would take their laryngoscope,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523010,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "come above the patient,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524550,
    "dDurationMs": 3110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and once they see the trachea,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 527660,
    "dDurationMs": 3163,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you start to pass your tube down inside."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531920,
    "dDurationMs": 3050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm almost there, I can see the light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534970,
    "dDurationMs": 1270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you can see right now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536240,
    "dDurationMs": 3650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just got it in to the trachea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539890,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh yeah.\n- Right there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 542097,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it took me a couple of minutes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 544850,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I was really kind of\nwrenching on this patient here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 548470,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as if there's somebody\nwho's not breathing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551050,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every second counts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 552450,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But by using a miniature\nversion of this vine robot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555660,
    "dDurationMs": 3430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "researchers are hoping to make\nintubation faster and safer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 559090,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You know, somebody\nlike me with no training"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561400,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "could pretty simply insert this device"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 565330,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "aimed towards the nose and..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568410,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(object squealing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570930,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571763,
    "dDurationMs": 3707,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you can see, we've already intubated,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 575470,
    "dDurationMs": 3363,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and all it took was a little\nbit of pressurization."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 578833,
    "dDurationMs": 867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(man laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579700,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580533,
    "dDurationMs": 2207,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It almost looks like\nsort of a party favor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582740,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584540,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This reminds me a lot of those inflatable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587300,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kind of like play-doh\nstructures you see at car lots."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 590970,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- How does it know to\ngo down the right tube?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 593440,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, so that's one of\nthe kind of cool things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595630,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about soft robotics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596620,
    "dDurationMs": 2090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is the robot is quite compliant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598710,
    "dDurationMs": 1910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we see that in a lot of these demos,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600620,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, they can squish, they can bend."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602930,
    "dDurationMs": 1190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so how we've designed it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 604120,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that the main robot grows\ndown into the esophagus,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607510,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then we have this side branch"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 608770,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that heads towards the trachea,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610820,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's quite flexible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 612320,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so it basically finds the opening."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614320,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's a really neat example"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616060,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of kind of a passive intelligence,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618370,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "mechanical intelligence\nsome people call it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620240,
    "dDurationMs": 1790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where it can find its path"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622030,
    "dDurationMs": 2553,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even if we don't know\nexactly the shape beforehand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 625560,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Have you tried this\non a real person yet?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 627810,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Not on a real person,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 629070,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but we've actually tried\nthis in a cadaver lab."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 631890,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we've shown that we can move"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634350,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from this nice idealized version"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636830,
    "dDurationMs": 3130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to an actual in-vivo situation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639960,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and successfully intubate a patient."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642530,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- There's another application"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 643890,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is burrowing into sand or soil."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648150,
    "dDurationMs": 3070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you blow compressed air\ninto something like sand,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 651220,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it fluidizes, it becomes like a liquid,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 654660,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that can allow the vine robot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 656460,
    "dDurationMs": 4250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to grow into granular materials like sand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660710,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- If you've ever been to the beach"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 661930,
    "dDurationMs": 3610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you try to stick like you\numbrella pole into the ground,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665540,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's fairly difficult."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666750,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And I'm trying to push that\nprobe down into the sand,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 668820,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "no fluid decision."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670950,
    "dDurationMs": 3790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, it feels like it\nsort of gets wedged in there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674740,
    "dDurationMs": 1786,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Let's now turn on the air."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 676526,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(air hissing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677359,
    "dDurationMs": 1271,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 678630,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can feel it immediately."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 681660,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, wow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 683750,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, that's a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 685220,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So what we've done here is essentially,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687460,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we just blow a jet of air\nout the front of the robot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690640,
    "dDurationMs": 1670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that loosens up the sand enough"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 692310,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to reduce the force of the sand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694130,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that the robot just by tip extension"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 696270,
    "dDurationMs": 1315,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can make its way through."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697585,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(air hissing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 709350,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This makes vine robots an\nattractive option for NASA"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712360,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when they look for ways\nto study the surfaces"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 715110,
    "dDurationMs": 1187,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of other planets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716297,
    "dDurationMs": 2833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(machine roaring)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 721800,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Recently on Mars"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722700,
    "dDurationMs": 3310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they tried to have a burrowing\nrobot but it got stuck."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726010,
    "dDurationMs": 1810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Could you do it better\nbasically with this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 727820,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, that's a good question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 728653,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the Mars InSight mission,\nthey have this heat probe,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 732320,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the idea there was to be able\nto sort of hammer its way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 734760,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "down into the core,\nand then place a sensor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 737010,
    "dDurationMs": 2770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that could detect the temperature of Mars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 739780,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, the problem they ran into there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 741540,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that it turned out the\nmaterial that they put it in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 744450,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was more cohesive than they expected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 746370,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Inside the robot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 747203,
    "dDurationMs": 2097,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "something would wind up\nand then pound it down,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 749300,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wind up and pound it down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 750740,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it turned out there\nwasn't enough friction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753050,
    "dDurationMs": 1413,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between the probe and the sand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 754463,
    "dDurationMs": 1347,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what was really happening"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 755810,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was it would wind up pound\ndown, wind up pound down,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 759090,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wind up pound down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 760050,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it never actually got anywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 761370,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The advantage of something\nlike this, like tip extension,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 763230,
    "dDurationMs": 2410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is you'd have your base,\nyou start at the surface"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 765640,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you just keep extending your way down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 767940,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're not necessarily\nrelying on the interaction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770910,
    "dDurationMs": 3350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with what is surrounding\nit to make it work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 774260,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- What amazes me about vine robots"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 776510,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is how a plant inspired\nthis simple, elegant design."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 781470,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's so easy in fact that\nyou could build one yourself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 783920,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in as little as a minute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 785440,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are instructions\nonline that I'll link to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 788060,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But from that basic design"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 789440,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have come a huge variety of robots"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 792600,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with different applications,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794010,
    "dDurationMs": 3190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from archeology to search and rescue,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 797200,
    "dDurationMs": 3470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or intubation to space exploration."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 800670,
    "dDurationMs": 3699,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what else can you\nthink of to do with it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804369,
    "dDurationMs": 3083,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(electronic buzzing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 809120,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hey, this video is\nsponsored by Morning Brew,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 811860,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the free daily newsletter\nthat gets you up to speed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814300,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on business, finance and\ntech, in just five minutes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 817630,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For some years now, my main\nmethod of procrastinating"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 819870,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has been scrolling through news websites."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 822330,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to prevent that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 823260,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've tried cutting news\nout of my life altogether,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 825960,
    "dDurationMs": 1790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I still wanna stay informed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 827750,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Morning Brew offers\nthe perfect middle ground."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 830180,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's delivered to my inbox every\nmorning, seven days a week,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 832940,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's witty and informative\nunlike traditional news."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 836400,
    "dDurationMs": 1730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Plus it gives me\neverything I need to know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 838130,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I don't have to check news\nsites multiple times a day"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 840910,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make sure that I'm not missing\nsomething, like inflation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 844290,
    "dDurationMs": 2270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is currently running\nat its highest rate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 846560,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in nearly nine years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 847940,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or the impending Boba shortage"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 849520,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "due to supply chain\ndisruptions caused by COVID."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 852320,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Boba is a big deal in this household."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 854630,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you're interested in\nbusiness, finance and tech,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 856960,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then why not try out Morning Brew."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 859110,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can sign up for\nfree in under 15 seconds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 861370,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at morningbrew.com/veritasium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 863270,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I will put that link in the description."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 865250,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I wanna thank Morning Brew\nfor sponsoring this video,"
    } ]
  }, {
